{"id":"exams","name":"exams","aliases":[],"caption":"Typeset exam questions","authors":[{"id":"meer","active":true}],"copyright":[{"owner":"Hans van der Meer","year":"1993-1996"}],"license":"other-nonfree","descriptions":[{"language":null,"text":"<p>\n      Provides a class <tt>exam<\u002ftt>, which allows questions to be multiple\n      choice or free form long/short answer questions. Options include\n      the typesetting of the exam itself, an exam showing all the\n      answers and a collection of questions and answers; questions can\n      be parameterized; use of a random generator provides for\n      automatic shuffling of multiple choice items.\n    <\u002fp>\n  <p>\n      The <ref refid=\"exam\">exam<\u002fref> bundle also provides\n      a class <q>\n      <tt>exam<\u002ftt>\n    <\u002fq>. That bundle is\n      therefore incompatible with the present one, and the two should\n      not be installed on the same system.\n    <\u002fp>"}],"documentation":[{"language":null,"details":"Readme","href":"ctan:/macros/latex/contrib/exams/README"}],"ctan":{"path":"/macros/latex/contrib/exams","file":true},"topics":["class","exam"],"also":["answers"]}